参考标签与真实模型运行。本分支交付道路评测工具链及公开素材，并引入用户已确认的 D091 工程交付关闭范围；完整 D089 道路业务验收移交后续运营前任务，当前仍未通过。\n\n- 交付 331 条已独立 AI 二审参考；93 条首稿作为未完成库存移交。\n- 保留 19 观察局部审核的 15 项全局缺失、22 观察负结果和来源 hold；正式资产、配对、冻结与待评模型调用仍为 0。\n- 新工程门禁核验范围批准、原协议、固定归档、参考绑定及准确候选的完整 CI，只输出工程交付结论，不使原业务门禁通过。\n- 已合入 main 的 X1 工作并解决 7 处文档冲突，保留双方历史，未更改生产画像或部署。\n\n验证：65fc421a4ae0adfa029b7314592422aa9fdea74e 的 Ruff 和 9 项新门禁测试已通过，全量持续检查进行中。旧 cdf5382 的 2174 passed / 1 项 Windows 跳过仅对原候选负责，不转借给本候选。\n\n工程关闭以实际检查报告为准；准确状态见 docs/p6-engineering-readiness.md，业务后续任务见 docs/road-business-validation-backlog.md。本 PR 仍为草稿，未合并。","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-22T13:14:01Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T14:03:54Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"394676776bf36d7fa3a418c419391b23762fa724","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"SuperdeMan:work/p6-road-views-20261014","ref":"work/p6-road-views-20261014","repo":{"id":1376840984,"node_id":"R_kgDOUhDtGA","name":"drone-agent","full_name":"SuperdeMan/drone-agent","owner":{"login":"SuperdeMan","id":26322497,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MzIyNDk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26322497?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperdeMan","html_url":"https://github.com/SuperdeMan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperdeMan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperdeMan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperdeMan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperdeMan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperdeMan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperdeMan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperdeMan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperdeMan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperdeMan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"p